  rcases (show i < 7 ∨ (7 ≤ i ∧ i < 14) ∨ (14 ≤ i ∧ i < 21) ∨ (21 ≤ i ∧ i < 28) ∨ (28 ≤ i ∧ i < 35) ∨ (35 ≤ i ∧ i < 42) ∨ (42 ≤ i ∧ i < 85) ∨ (85 ≤ i ∧ i < 94) ∨ (94 ≤ i ∧ i < 109) ∨ (109 ≤ i ∧ i < 120) ∨ (120 ≤ i ∧ i < 128) ∨ (128 ≤ i ∧ i < 135) ∨ (135 ≤ i ∧ i < 142) ∨ (142 ≤ i ∧ i < 149) ∨ (149 ≤ i ∧ i < 156) ∨ (156 ≤ i ∧ i < 163) ∨ (163 ≤ i ∧ i < 170) ∨ 170 ≤ i by omega) with h | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | h1
  · exact nodeCapNu_of_rangeOK heps tailNu_nonneg tailNu_lt_one tailAnchor12_00
      (tailExclCaps12 heps) (Nat.zero_le _) h hi hc
  · exact nodeCapNu_of_rangeOK heps tailNu_nonneg tailNu_lt_one tailAnchor12_01
      (tailExclCaps12 heps) h1 h2 hi hc
  · exact nodeCapNu_of_rangeOK heps tailNu_nonneg tailNu_lt_one tailAnchor12_02
      (tailExclCaps12 heps) h1 h2 hi hc
