      (tailExclCaps12 heps) h1 h2 hi hc
  · exact nodeCapNu_of_rangeOK heps tailNu_nonneg tailNu_lt_one tailAnchor12_04
      (tailExclCaps12 heps) h1 h2 hi hc
  · exact nodeCapNu_of_rangeOK heps tailNu_nonneg tailNu_lt_one tailAnchor12_05
      (tailExclCaps12 heps) h1 h2 hi hc
